			"notes": "## Copper Companions v1.0.0 - NeoForge\n\nNeoForge port of Copper Companions for Minecraft 1.21.9.\n\n### Features\n\n- Copper golems pick up items \n- Prioritizes valuable items \n- Puts music discs in jukeboxes automatically\n- Fully configurable behavior\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.9+\n- NeoForge 21.9.5-beta+\n\n### Installation\n\n1. Download coppercompanions-1.0.0-neoforge.jar\n2. Place in your mods/ folder\n3. Restart Minecraft\n\n### What's New in NeoForge Port\n\n- Improved event handling for NeoForge architecture"
